snippet.description:
Trying to redesign my LEGO minifig-scale brick separator. I think this is about as small as I can get it while still having some sort of LEGO bar for the minfig to hold onto. Now the question is how detailed can I make it look? So I'm going to try using an even smaller nozzle on my Snapmaker U1 3D printer. 

@Snapmaker 

